<title>USA: Michigan $84.5 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Michigan $84.5 mln deal repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Wednesday it repriced $84.5 million Michigan State Housing Development Authority bonds, raising yields five basis points and moving the top yield in 2027 to 6.20 percent from 6.15 percent.</p>
